          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Colour the sectors of the circle below so that the figure has i) 3 angles of symmetry, ii) 4 angles of symmetry, iii) what are the possible numbers of angles of symmetry you can obtain by colouring the sectors in different ways?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.428,
            0.238,
            0.62,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.428,
                0.238,
                0.62,
                0.383
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_21_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.402,
            0.884,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Draw two figures other than a circle and a square that have both reflection symmetry and rotational symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.447,
            0.669,
            0.468
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Draw, wherever possible, a rough sketch of:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.235,
            0.47,
            0.884,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. A triangle with at least two lines of symmetry and at least two angles of symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.516,
            0.885,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. A triangle with only one line of symmetry but not having rotational symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.561,
            0.833,
            0.604
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "c. A quadrilateral with rotational symmetry but no reflection symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.606,
            0.833,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "d. A quadrilateral with reflection symmetry but not having rotational symmetry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.848,
            0.559,
            0.949,
            0.645
