          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. In a figure, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the smallest angle of symmetry. What are the other angles of symmetry of this figure?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.698,
            0.885,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. In a figure, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is an angle of symmetry. The figure has two angles of symmetry less than 60°. What is its smallest angle of symmetry?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.743,
            0.884,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Can we have a figure with rotational symmetry whose smallest angle of symmetry is:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.79,
            0.307,
            0.808
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 5 ^ { \\circ } ?"
